Design Highlights &amp; Visual Intent

The page turns a resume into a calm, evidence-led narrative. A warm off-white paper tone keeps it human, while near-black sections signal gravity. Terracotta accents draw the eye to numbers and achievements without shouting.

· Typography: Fraunces serif headlines feel editorial and authoritative, while IBM Plex Mono for labels and numbers evokes data dashboards. The pairing is intentional—expressive storytelling supported by precise data.
· Signature hero visual: An abstract dot grid represents a 40,000+ employee workforce, with a rising diagonal band of warm dots symbolising internal mobility and succession. The animation is subtle—dots pulse in sequence—and can be paused, keeping motion respectful.
· Layout rhythm: Long-form sections alternate between paper and dark backgrounds, mimicking a strategic report. The three-column ledger and timeline structure make dense career information scannable without feeling like a wall of text.
· Motion: Entrance animations are staggered and measured. Scroll reveals are gentle and happen once. The hero's word-by-word name reveal adds a personal, crafted touch.

The overall effect is a portfolio that feels like a senior HR leader's dossier: structured, analytical, and quietly confident.

